# Lagorin, Soul of Alacria: "Whenever Lagorin attacks while saddled, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target Mounts
# and/or Vehicles." Saddle 1 is paid by Llanowar Elves. Lagorin attacks as a flier and chooses itself and Reckoner Bankbuster (a
# Vehicle that is not a creature, still a legal target). Llanowar Elves is not a Mount or Vehicle and is refused. Both get a
# +1/+1 counter before damage, so Lagorin hits for 2.

